1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Jedna od najtraženijih molekula

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:02,710
na svijetu,

3
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:04,000
rođena je u Zagrebu.

4
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:05,114
Devedesetih,

5
00:00:05,114 --> 00:00:07,176
tim sa zagrebačkog Medicinskog

6
00:00:07,176 --> 00:00:08,825
fakulteta izdvojio je iz

7
00:00:08,825 --> 00:00:10,405
ljudskog želučanog soka

8
00:00:10,405 --> 00:00:11,985
jedan zaštitni protein.

9
00:00:11,985 --> 00:00:12,672
A u njemu,

10
00:00:12,672 --> 00:00:13,840
jedan kratak niz.

11
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:15,596
Petnaest aminokiselina.

12
00:00:15,596 --> 00:00:16,680
Tačno ovim redom.

13
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:19,880
Nazvali su ga BPC-157.

14
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:21,978
Od tada, više od trideset

15
00:00:21,978 --> 00:00:23,714
godina i stotine naučnih

16
00:00:23,714 --> 00:00:25,377
radova traže odgovor na

17
00:00:25,377 --> 00:00:26,318
isto pitanje:

18
00:00:26,318 --> 00:00:28,126
kako tako mali lanac nosi

19
00:00:28,126 --> 00:00:29,500
tako veliku poruku?

20
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:30,788
Petnaest karika.

21
00:00:30,788 --> 00:00:31,724
Ako jedna fali,

22
00:00:31,724 --> 00:00:33,596
ili stoji na pogrešnom mjestu,

23
00:00:33,596 --> 00:00:35,280
to više nije ista molekula.

24
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:37,230
Zato je preciznost sve.

25
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:38,456
Rođena u Zagrebu.

26
00:00:38,456 --> 00:00:40,260
Proizvedena u Švicarskoj.

27
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:41,950
Prati Peptid Centar.

28
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:43,560
Sljedeća molekula stiže

29
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,050
uskoro.

